From: Himess <semihcvlk53@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 21 Oct 2026 18:27:33 +0300
Subject: [PATCH 3/6] test(host-contracts): E2 retirement-certificate tests
 (TC19, TC24)

The ERC's published vector (valid on 1 and 11155111, refused on 31337);
wrong chain; successor mismatch; no successor; invalid, short, high-s and
wrong-scope signatures; an ERC-1271 wallet; a 7702 account with no ECDSA
fallback; while paused; a second submission; a retired submitter; a
leaked certificate yields only the planned handover; scope across chains.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
